# WireGuard credentials for gluetun — copy to secrets/vpn.env, fill in,
# then `./scripts/secrets encrypt`.
#
# From your VPN provider's WireGuard config generator. For Mullvad:
# account page -> WireGuard configuration -> generate a key, then copy
# the three values out of the generated config.
#
# No endpoint pin: provider mode picks a live server. Pinning a specific
# server address is a time bomb — servers get retired, and gluetun then
# fails with 'target IP address not found'.
#
# This file stays separate from every other secret on purpose: gluetun
# is its own trust domain, and nothing else may ever see the VPN key.
WIREGUARD_PRIVATE_KEY=
WIREGUARD_PUBLIC_KEY=
WIREGUARD_ADDRESSES=
